{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54595","headline":"兵要望江南 占虹霓第七（京本作「占虹第九」○十一首） 四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占虹霓第七（京本作「占虹第九」○十一首） 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虹赤白，尽是阻军行。\n若是（京本作「似」）虹桥栏着路，且须盘泊犒（京本作「靠」）军兵，不久却回程。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54595.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54595","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}